[
  {
    "id": "2469394",
    "original": "求めよ、さらば与へられん。尋ねよ、さらば見出さん。門を叩け、さらば開かれん。すべて求むる者は得、たづぬる者は見いだし、門をたたく者は開かるるなり。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "2469485",
        "text": "Ask, and it shall be given to you; seek, and ye shall find; knock, and it shall be opened to you; for every one who is asking doth receive, and he who is seeking doth find, and to him who is knocking it shall be opened."
      },
      {
